      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First release of QuickCut, a tiny Mac app for quick video edits.

- Open videos, cut at the playhead, delete the parts you don't want and drag the rest into order
- Save the whole edit, or right-click any clip to save it as its own file
- Nothing is re-encoded, so even long 4K videos save almost instantly]]></description>
